  "title": "Authentic Vietnamese Spring Rolls (Nem Ran Hay Cha Gio)",
  "description": "These Vietnamese fried spring rolls are made with chicken, shrimp, and veggies rolled in rice paper, then fried for a crowd-pleasing party appetizer.",
  "authors": [
    "agoldstone"
  ],
